# Secrets. .env holds STACKARR_ADMIN_PASSWORD, STACKARR_ADMIN_USERNAME and
# TINYMEDIAMANAGER_PASSWORD in plaintext. Never commit it - a secret pushed to a
# remote stays readable in the history even after a later commit removes it.
.env

# All runtime state: service databases, qBittorrent config and its password
# hash, Jellyfin's database, generated compose, logs, media and downloads
# (~566M). This is recreated by stackarr, so nothing here is source.
.stackarr/

# .env.example is the tracked, secret-free template and must not be ignored.
!.env.example
